{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/887794-alternate-boons","id":887794,"title":"Alternate Boons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-10T20:36:00-07:00","id":887794,"title":"Alternate Boons","content":"Alright, I was sitting there looking at the Guardian Purview, mainly because I am currently playing a Scion who is in line to be a God of Guardianship and one of the prerequisites of having a Boon associated with you as a God is to have 1 Boon at each level of the Purview as well as the Avatar. This turns out to be a problem for me as Guardian: 7 is Confer Immunity. This is a perfectly good Boon if you have immunities to confer, but as I do not, this boon is a shit waste of my xp to spend, but not purchasing a Guardian Boon for the 7th dot would negate my ability to have it associated. <br /> <br /> So does anyone know of a fan made 7th Dot Guardian Boons out there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T16:02:15-07:00","id":889415,"title":"","content":"Here's one I got sometime before 2013 from the forums (I think): <b>None Shall Pass </b>(5Legend/ use; Dice Pool: Perception + Awareness) The Scion with this Boon is so attuned to defending her charges that no one, not even those with divine power, can pass her with impunity. Whenever she chooses to spend the requisite cost, she may place an area with a radius of up to 100 yards per success she rolls under her protection, placing it on magical lockdown; no Boons may be used to enter it via supernatural means while she is on guard. Traveling Boons such as Earth Travel, Divine Pass, Flame Travel or the majority of the Psychopomp purview simply fail to work when used to attempt to enter the area without the Scion\u2019s blessing unless the being using them can best the Scion\u2019s successes with a Wits + Stealth roll. The Scion may allow anyone she trusts the ability to use traveling powers within the area, but those who do not ask her permission and fail to overcome her iron resolve find themselves simply standing where they started, having inexplicably failed to move. The area remains thus protected until the Scion leaves it, at which point it may be freely traveled through again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1087-sylvanwulf","name":"Sylvanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T18:51:18-07:00","id":889537,"title":"","content":"That's a good one, do you happen to know who came up with that, because I want to present that one to the Admin for the site as an alternate Level 7 Boon, but I'd like to credit the creator of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T20:13:40-07:00","id":889584,"title":"","content":"I found this link with a few more boons for Guardian<br /> <a href=\"https://scion-taking-it-to-the-titans.obsidianportal.com/wiki_pages/guardian-purview\" target=\"_blank\">https://scion-taking-it-to-the-titan...ardian-purview</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/333-achilles","name":"Achilles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar333_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T08:13:02-07:00","id":889907,"title":"","content":"I don't remember who came up with it, I just have it on my sheet as &quot;WW Forums&quot;: could have been Telgar, John (JSR), Gotham By Night... I think it was one of the first few that I found from the old forums for the first game I ran. Sorry I can't be of more help!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1087-sylvanwulf","name":"Sylvanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T18:26:53-07:00","id":890315,"title":"","content":"All good, you pointed me in the direction of the boon so that's a start. Plus given me some names so I can ask them directly<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-13T21:01:43-07:00","id":890387,"title":"","content":"That Boon is from John's Scion Resources (which <b>is</b> GothamByNight). They're no longer hosting their material, and have asked that it not be widely distributed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T08:02:37-07:00","id":890566,"title":"","content":"Damn, so close to not having to pay xp for a Boon that is not completely useless for my particular scion *L* <br /> <br /> Alright, thanks","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}